flowchart TD
  C[Parse and validate service_convergence before mutation]
  C --> S[Service-manager-owned stop or reload]
  S --> T[Stop convergence<br/>default 5 min]
  T --> U[Unload convergence<br/>default 5 min]
  U --> B[Install candidate and ask service manager to start]
  B --> L[TCP listener-open convergence<br/>default 5 min]
  L --> R[Authenticated full readiness convergence<br/>default 15 min]
  R --> K[Commit candidate and retain service-manager ownership]
  T -->|deadline| E[Exact unfinished stage and deadline<br/>recoverable state retained]
  U -->|deadline| E
  L -->|deadline| E
  R -->|deadline| E
  C -->|outside 1 sec to 1 hour| V[Reject before service mutation]
